<style>
  .pr-wrap { max-width: 840px; }
  .pr-head { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .pr-head__badge { font-size:11px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--pn-purple); background:var(--pn-purple-soft); padding:6px 12px; border-radius:20px; }
  .pr-card { padding: 32px 36px; }
  .pr-card h3 { font-size:20px; font-weight:900; margin: 24px 0 10px; letter-spacing:-.3px; color:var(--pn-ink); }
  .pr-card h3:first-child { margin-top:0; }
  .pr-card p { font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:var(--pn-ink-2); margin-bottom:14px; }
  .pr-card ul { margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 4px; list-style:none; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:9px; }
  .pr-card li { font-size:15px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--pn-ink); padding-left:26px; position:relative; }
  .pr-card li::before { content:'✓'; position:absolute; left:0; color:var(--pn-purple); font-weight:900; }
  .pr-empty { padding:60px 20px; text-align:center; color:var(--pn-muted); }
  .pr-empty svg { width:44px; height:44px; stroke:var(--pn-muted); margin-bottom:14px; }
  .pr-extra { margin-top:18px; }
  .pr-rows { display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
  .pr-row { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--pn-border); }
  .pr-row:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
  .pr-row.is-pasado { opacity:.55; }
  .pr-row__b { flex:1; min-width:0; }
  .pr-row__b strong { display:block; font-size:14px; font-weight:800; }
  .pr-row__b small { font-size:12px; color:var(--pn-muted); font-weight:600; }
  .pr-row__n { text-align:right; flex-shrink:0; }
  .pr-row__n span { display:block; font-size:14px; font-weight:800; color:var(--pn-ink); }
  .pr-row__n small { font-size:11.5px; color:var(--pn-muted); font-weight:600; }
  .pr-bar { position:relative; height:11px; border-radius:20px; background:#F1F0F5; overflow:visible; margin:14px 0 10px; }
  .pr-bar__sold { display:block; height:100%; border-radius:20px; background:var(--pn-purple); }
  .pr-bar__be { position:absolute; top:-4px; width:3px; height:19px; border-radius:2px; background:var(--pn-ink); }
  .pr-legend { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--pn-muted); font-weight:600; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .pr-card { padding: 22px 20px; } }
</style>
<div class="pr-wrap">
  {{#if panel.presentationTitle}}
  <div class="pr-head">
    <span class="pr-head__badge">{{panel.presentationTitle}}</span>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if panel.presentation}}
  <div class="pn-card pr-card">
    {{{panel.presentation}}}
  </div>

  {{else}}
  <div class="pn-card pr-empty">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 3 14 8 19 8"/></svg>
    <p>Aún no hay una presentación para esta edición.</p>
  </div>
  {{/if}}

  {{#if panel.capital.items.length}}
  <div class="pn-card pr-card pr-extra">
    <h3>Uso del capital</h3>
    <p>En qu&eacute; se est&aacute; aplicando el presupuesto de la edici&oacute;n. Presupuestado
      <strong>{{panel.capital.totalBudget}}</strong> · ejercido <strong>{{panel.capital.totalSpent}}</strong>
      ({{panel.capital.spentPct}}%).</p>
    <div class="pr-rows">
      {{#each panel.capital.items}}
      <div class="pr-row">
        <div class="pr-row__b">
          <strong>{{this.label}}</strong>
          {{#if this.note}}<small>{{this.note}}</small>{{/if}}
        </div>
        <div class="pr-row__n">
          <span>{{this.budgetLabel}}</span>
          <small>ejercido {{this.spentLabel}}</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  </div>
  {{/if}}

  {{#if panel.sales.capacity}}
  <div class="pn-card pr-card pr-extra">
    <h3>Punto de equilibrio</h3>
    <p>Con un aforo de <strong>{{panel.sales.capacityLabel}}</strong>, el evento se equilibra en
      <strong>{{panel.sales.breakEvenLabel}}</strong> boletos.
      {{#if panel.sales.pastBreakEven}}Ya se super&oacute;.{{else}}Faltan <strong>{{panel.sales.toBreakEvenLabel}}</strong>.{{/if}}</p>
    <div class="pr-bar">
      <i class="pr-bar__sold" style="width:{{panel.sales.soldPct}}%"></i>
      <span class="pr-bar__be" style="left:{{panel.sales.breakEvenPct}}%"></span>
    </div>
    <p class="pr-legend">Vendidos {{panel.sales.soldLabel}} · taquilla {{panel.sales.boxOffice}} de {{panel.sales.goalBoxOffice}} posible.
      La marca vertical es el punto de equilibrio.</p>
  </div>
  {{/if}}

  {{#if panel.timeline.length}}
  <div class="pn-card pr-card pr-extra">
    <h3>Calendario del proyecto</h3>
    <p>Las etapas y actividades con fecha, en orden.</p>
    <div class="pr-rows">
      {{#each panel.timeline}}
      <div class="pr-row {{#if this.pasado}}is-pasado{{/if}}">
        <div class="pr-row__b">
          <strong>{{this.title}}</strong>
          <small>{{#eq this.kind 'etapa'}}Etapa{{else}}Actividad{{/eq}}{{#if this.meta}} · {{this.meta}}{{/if}}</small>
        </div>
        <div class="pr-row__n"><span>{{this.fechaLabel}}</span></div>
      </div>
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  </div>
  {{/if}}

</div>
